e subspecies who've lived on Borneo for 300,000 years","description":"Jusqu'en 2004, on pensait que les éléphants pygmées de la forêt de Bornéo étaient des descendants d'éléphants indiens domestiqués.  Aujourd'hui, les tests ADN montrent qu'il s'agit d'une sous-espèce unique qui vit à Bornéo depuis 300 000 ans.","duration":3540000,"originalContentDuration":3195000,"allotment":3540,"rating":"10","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/605376c3e85e72001a62bd50/screenshot16_9_1778777642137.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Documentary","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/605376c3e85e72001a62bd50/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/605376c3e85e72001a62bd50/poster_1778777642137.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/605376c3e85e72001a62bd50/screenshot4_3_1778777642137.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=640"},{"aspectRatio":"16:9","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/605376c3e85e72001a62bd50/screenshot16_9_1778777642137.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"}],"categories":[{"id":"66d9b6d2cb8890000854aa28"}],"poster16_9":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/assets/images/default/vod.screenshot16_9-default.jpg"},"clip":{"actors":["SAM WEST","MOHAMMAD DIN MOHAMMAD"],"directors":["JOE KENNEDY"],"originalReleaseDate":"2006-01-01T00:00:00Z"},"avail":{},"stream_url":"https://cfd-v4-service-channel-stitcher-use1-1.prd.pluto.tv/v2/stitch/hls/episode/605376c3e85e72001a62bd50/master.m3u8?advertisingId=&appName=web&appVersion=7.9.0-a9cca6b89aea4dc0998b92a51989d2adb9a9025d&app_name=web&clientDeviceType=0&clientID=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&clientModelNumber=1.0.0&country=FR&deviceDNT=false&deviceId=688e2fcf-3b1e-4478-a146-7d2b26ed9b90&deviceLat=50.6900&deviceLon=3.1800&deviceMake=Chrome&deviceModel=web&deviceType=web&deviceVersion=16.2.0&marketingRegion=FR